# The Turtle example of lomo:legalText in the specification of LOMO 1.1.0
# (https://drpm.pages.code.europa.eu/lomo/latest/#legalText), with the prefixes it uses.
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix lomo: <http://data.europa.eu/leg/lomo#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix dct: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix dctype: <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/> .
@prefix cpsv: <http://purl.org/vocab/cpsv#> .
@prefix eli: <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#> .
@prefix tf: <http://data.europa.eu/leg/temporal-function/> .
@prefix dm: <http://data.europa.eu/leg/deontic-modality/> .
@prefix dd: <http://data.europa.eu/leg/digital-dimensions/> .
@prefix rc: <http://data.europa.eu/leg/result-category/> .
@prefix role: <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/role/> .

ex:Rule_Dir2013_34_Art53 a lomo:PrescriptiveRule ;
    lomo:legalText "Member States shall bring into force the laws, regulations and administrative provisions necessary to comply with this Directive by 20 July 2015."@en .